# 背景色変更を、カーネル内の基本図形編集・基本文章編集・仮身一覧とプロセスとで同じにする
# (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py. For each of the three, a copy (mkbig) is opened with the
# desktop's own editor (open, after figproc, docproc, cabproc kernel), then another with the
# process (pfig, pdoc, pcab). 背景色変更 of 表示 opens the desktop's pop-up of colours at the
# pointer: its choice HEX (182 across from the pointer, at 685 down, the pop-up being kept on
# the screen) is pressed, what the box holds taken back and c8e0f0 typed, then Enter. Saved with
# Ctrl+S: the paper the object's metadata keeps (paper) and record 0 (sum) are the same,
# whichever editor changed it, and the work area shows the paper (pixel). The paper is kept in
# the metadata when it is chosen; the process's text editor writes no record 0 on Ctrl+S when
# its letters were not changed (no "saved"), and record 0 stays as made. The menu is opened
# at 500,400 with 閉じる under the pointer, the rows 20 apart (閉じる, a line, 保存, 表示, ...);
# 表示's own opens beside it, its first row on 表示's row: 背景色変更 is its sixth row in
# 基本図形編集 (道具パネル表示, 実寸パネル表示, パターン編集, 全画面表示, 再表示, 背景色変更),
# its seventh in 基本文章編集 (three modes, a line, 全画面表示, 再表示, 背景色変更) and its
# third in 仮身一覧. Chosen, the menu opens with 表示 under the pointer: 閉じる, three rows up,
# closes the window and leaves 閉じる the row chosen last.
# Keys: Backspace 2A, Enter 28, Ctrl+S 16 01.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- 基本図形編集
figproc kernel
mkbig fig 30 4
open big
waitwin 画用紙 600
sync 600
wait 800
click 500 400 1
wait 800
move 510 460
wait 300
move 650 460
move 650 560
wait 300
click 650 560
wait 1000
wait 800
shot pp_fig_k_pick
click 832 685
wait 300
key 2A
key 2A
key 2A
key 2A
key 2A
key 2A
key 2A
text c8e0f0
wait 500
key 28
sync 600
wait 800
pixel 850 650 C8E0F0
key 16 01
sync 600
paper
keep fig_paper
sum
keep fig
click 500 400 1
wait 800
move 510 340
wait 300
click 510 340
sync 600
wait 500

mkbig fig 30 4
logmark
pfig big
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 32
wait 800
logmark
click 500 400 1
wait 800
move 510 460
wait 300
move 650 460
move 650 560
wait 300
click 650 560
expectsince figure: chosen bgcolour
wait 800
shot pp_fig_p_pick
click 832 685
wait 300
key 2A
key 2A
key 2A
key 2A
key 2A
key 2A
key 2A
text c8e0f0
wait 500
key 28
wait 1000
pixel 850 650 C8E0F0
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince figure: saved (0)
paper
same fig_paper
sum
same fig
logmark
click 500 400 1
wait 800
move 510 340
wait 300
click 510 340
expectsince figure: chosen close
expectsince figure: closed
wait 500
figproc 0

